Physical Review B 56,3598–3601. Primary author-paper text: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/30762975_Composite_fermions_in_periodic_and_random_antidot_lattices . Institutional record: https://epub.uni-regensburg.de/7895/ . The paper compares periodic, random and unpatterned antidot transport near half filling and specifies fabrication and illumination controls.

